#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:6
msgid "Wireless TV Shield"
msgstr "Wireless TV Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Wireless TV Shield combines a VS23S010 SPI-to-NTSC video generator with "
"an MM213TL 5.8 GHz analog video transmitter so the OpenMV Cam can broadcast "
"its frames to an FPV receiver."
msgstr ""
"El Wireless TV Shield combina un generador de vídeo SPI-a-NTSC VS23S010 con "
"un transmisor de vídeo analógico MM213TL de 5,8 GHz, de modo que la OpenMV "
"Cam pueda emitir sus fotogramas a un receptor FPV."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/wireless-tv-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `Wireless TV Shield product"
" page <https://openmv.io/products/wireless-tv-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Para ver la hoja de datos completa, fotos y opciones de compra, consulta la "
"`página del producto Wireless TV Shield "
"<https://openmv.io/products/wireless-tv-shield>`_."

